# scripts/opcount: `collectbench bench fold N` collects N elements in parts
# of 64 and only folds each part (GP-FOLD); the cost of one element is the
# slope between the two sizes. The control collects each part, then folds
# it, as hand Go does.
unit element
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench fold {n}
control benchmarks/collect/testdata/control
